Exceptions

src/liboah/cp_data.h contains the PowerPC "commpage" routines of the xnu kernel,
which Apple published under the Apple Public Source License 2.0
(https://opensource.apple.com/apsl/).

This repository contains no other Apple software. Rosetta, Mac OS X and its
frameworks are Apple's; install.sh uses the copies exported from your own
Snow Leopard installation.
